      "text": "Staging (3a → 3b → 3c):\n3a — bare compacted alignment drivable, no interchange/signage detail\n3b — real interchange ramp geometry + service-road connections layered in\n3c — real exit-number signage + HOV lane markings (cosmetic until TraCI traffic)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top" },

    { "id": "footer", "type": "text", "x": 600, "y": 440, "width": 680, "height": 90, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6272a4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 27, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 27, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null,
      "text": "Real distance Manhattan → county line ≈ 31 mi.\nTarget compacted length: 16-20 mi (≈ 50-65% of real).\nInterchange geometry preserved at true scale; only the\nlong straight stretches between landmarks are compressed.\nTerrain is essentially flat — no elevation modeling needed.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top" }
